# netkeeper
===
 NetKeeper (Campus Network Keep-Alive Assistant) is a Windows/Linux desktop application based on Electron + Vue 3 + TypeScript + Vite. It is used to automatically detect the campus network connectivity status and automatically re-authenticate when the external network is unreachable. ..
